  <div class="case-takeaway">
    <h3>Key takeaways</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <div class="tone-junior">A gzipped-size number tells you the bundle grew, not which import grew it — a treemap shows every module sized by actual bytes, so the culprit is visually obvious.</div>
        <div class="tone-mid">Compare before/after treemaps and look for the box that appeared or grew — it's very often a dependency imported more broadly than intended, not your own code.</div>
        <div class="tone-staff">Automate the diagnosis you did by hand once — a CI check that diffs the top-N modules by size against main catches the next version of the same regression before merge.</div>
